WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:25.270 --> 00:01:30.040
Daram Zuba and Gije of the Buff Clan
 aliens received a new Heavy Mobile Mecha,

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.940
the Galbo Jick, and used it to attack
Cosmo and the Solo Ship.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:41.550
Perhaps it was Cosmo's thoughts of Kitten that
enabled him to defeat this new weapon.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:47.500
Cosmo and his friends fled from Daram's
 pursuit and entered the Earth Sphere.

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:55.590
<b>The Strenuous Lunar Base Infiltration</b>

00:02:06.270 --> 00:02:08.390
A meteor is falling towards Earth.

00:02:08.390 --> 00:02:09.230
Yes.

00:02:09.370 --> 00:02:10.910
The rumors were true.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.790
That was pretty!

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:15.520
I want to see it again.

00:02:15.980 --> 00:02:19.040
With this one, how many meteors does that make?

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:21.300
Must be seventeen or eighteen by now...

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:27.750
Whether that shooting star is
 a sign of misfortune or good luck...

00:02:27.910 --> 00:02:30.670
That might be up for us to decide.

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:31.540
That's right.

00:02:31.660 --> 00:02:34.460
But things can't get any worse than this.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:37.090
Earth is right before our eyes.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.480
The Logo Dau aliens escaped into
 an extremely remote sector of space.

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:58.480
Do they have another colony planet here?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:02.170
What if their home planet was here of all places?

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:04.520
It's a possibility.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.580
The Galbo Jick is being repaired.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.750
Let's send a computer controlled
 squad for reconnaissance.

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:14.290
If it is their home planet, we should
see more resistance than usual.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:15.670
We'll see.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:18.460
Unmanned Zurow Jick, launching!

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:40.240
Our Earth...

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:43.480
The military is telling us to go back!?

00:03:43.660 --> 00:03:46.160
What's this all about?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:46.910
Let's go!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:48.080
Never mind them.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.250
We'll keep going to Earth!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:50.700
A ship!

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:53.420
A science academy ship is coming up!

00:03:53.740 --> 00:03:55.170
They seem to be in a hurry...

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:55.830
What?

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:14.560
I'm Kiranin Colbock from the Science Academy.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.600
Tell us!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:18.270
Why aren't we allowed to land on Earth?

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:18.940
We...

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:24.040
The military refuses to let you in
 because you brought aliens with you.

00:04:24.650 --> 00:04:25.760
Do you want us to get killed?!

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.160
Hold on, Kasha. Do you want us to get killed?!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.290
What's someone from the
science academy doing here, then?

00:04:31.500 --> 00:04:35.800
I've heard about the research on the
 Sixth Civilization from Dr. Formossa.

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.820
Will you lend the data to me so I can do my analysis?

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:42.760
If we can use the supercomputer
Gloria, we'll give you the data.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.590
Gloria?

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.720
It's impossible.

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:46.930
Why?

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:50.570
It's under military jurisdiction. 
Someone from the science academy can't...

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:51.430
Enemy attack!

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:52.850
Enemy attack!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.390
Okay, time to take off!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:25.380
Damn it! Ideo-Delta, launching!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:28.180
Ideo-Nova, launching!

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.800
Ideo-Buster, launching!

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.270
As fast as usual!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.460
Second block, what are you doing?

00:05:58.460 --> 00:05:59.830
Fire the Glen Cannon!

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.340
I'm trying, but they're moving too fast!

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:05.130
Go down!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:11.470
Cosmo, Kasha!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.970
We can't win this way! We need to dock!

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.100
Understood!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.480
Kasha, get into position for docking!

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:18.730
Roger!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:47.710
Not bad!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:06.900
I'll blow you all away!

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:20.120
We did it!

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.360
Don't let your guard down.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:22.830
There might still be more of them.

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:32.130
Is this the Ideon?

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.970
An artifact of the Sixth Civilization?

00:07:35.760 --> 00:07:37.260
So is the Solo Ship.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:41.850
But the problem is their mysterious energy.

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:46.480
A legendary force that most
 likely powers this ship and the Ideon.

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:48.070
Mysterious energy?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:50.440
It's called the Ide.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:54.410
I want to investigate it and its control system.

00:07:54.820 --> 00:08:00.080
And these aliens believe that
the Ide's energy is infinite.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.500
Infinite energy?

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:03.860
Mr. Colbock, can't you get us to Gloria somehow?

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:09.250
If you're willing to accept some risks, there's a way.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:12.390
Gloria's terminal system is on Moonland.

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:13.380
On the moon?

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:18.750
The Giant's power seems to be on the rise.

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:22.270
Our computer data is outdated after all.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:24.730
We're changing the plan.

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.260
Attack that satellite base from three directions.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:30.730
That will disperse the Giant's power.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.240
They're going to attack Moonland!

00:08:39.350 --> 00:08:40.820
Cosmo, what do we do?

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:41.880
Go after them, Kasha!

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.040
Cosmo!

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:44.790
Sheryl and the others are going
to land on the Moon.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:45.710
Cover them!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:46.790
What'd you say?

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.880
Gloria's terminal systems are on the moon.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.800
Roger.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:53.840
We'll do what we can, but I won't guarantee anything.

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:57.020
But Cosmo, I believe in your strength.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:01.520
What was that all about, Sheryl?

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:05.270
But only you can figure out the
 secrets of Ide, so I won't let you die.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.230
Are you okay?

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.150
I'm fine!

00:09:08.150 --> 00:09:09.770
Your wound still hurts, doesn't it?

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:11.400
I'm fine!

00:09:32.090 --> 00:09:33.380
Kasha! Moera!

00:09:33.380 --> 00:09:36.010
To stop their bombardment, we have
to destroy every single one of them!

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:36.670
Roger!

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.560
Stay prepared if the soldiers find us.

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:46.600
Yes.

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:00.740
In front!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:01.570
Hey!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:07.830
Cosmo...

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:08.540
Over there.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:16.010
Hatari!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:16.970
Any response from Earth?

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.090
Nothing yet!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.930
Only Earth can save the Moon Base!

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.210
Why aren't they sending reinforcements?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:25.740
Are they going to let everyone on the moon die?

00:10:27.970 --> 00:10:28.930
Sir Daram!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.480
Judging from the fact that they're
 not sending reinforcements...

00:10:32.560 --> 00:10:36.150
That may not be the home
planet of the Logo Dau aliens.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:37.190
Yes.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.010
However, there's one thing that bothers me.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:46.540
Meteors have been falling on
this planet, just like on Planet Buff.

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:48.160
Is it a coincidence?

00:10:49.370 --> 00:10:51.120
You're looking too much into it, Gije.

00:10:51.620 --> 00:10:57.460
Even if you were right, our
first priority is to get the Giant.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:58.090
Yes, sir.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:10:59.850
What is your next strategy?

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:02.840
I'll take off alone in the Galbo Jick.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:06.780
Sir Daram, stay here on the
 Gerowa Zan and set up a trap.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.550
I'll lure them here one by one.

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:11.310
So I can attack them?

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.020
Yes!

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:26.870
Mr. Colbock!

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:29.610
Even if we manage to sneak in,
 can you really use that computer?

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.520
The Academy has information on military computers.

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.510
I can use it.

00:11:43.050 --> 00:11:44.760
Is that the computer center?

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.890
Cosmo, in front!

00:11:45.890 --> 00:11:46.550
Okay!

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:48.530
It's better that we don't let them come any closer!

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:54.220
Cosmo, why are you slowing down?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:54.690
Don't panic!

00:11:55.020 --> 00:11:57.030
But you're acting different from usual!

00:11:57.270 --> 00:12:00.690
For Sheryl's sake, we need to act as a decoy.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.460
Deck, listen!

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:17.620
We're going to draw off the enemies!

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:19.320
How?

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:20.610
This is what we'll do!

00:12:24.470 --> 00:12:26.430
Don't waste this opportunity, Sheryl.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.100
Please respond!

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.600
This is Moonland!

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.420
We are under attack by aliens!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:34.930
Please respond!

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:35.560
Please!

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:37.810
Don't abandon us! This is Moonland!

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:49.540
What's the keyword?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:50.870
I know it.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.730
You Academy people are reliable.

00:12:52.830 --> 00:12:53.370
Right...

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:56.490
But despite that, I sometimes can't
 figure out the most trivial things.

00:12:57.380 --> 00:12:58.960
But that's just how life is.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:00.170
That's right.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.970
Is the input system the same as normal?

00:13:04.840 --> 00:13:06.680
Those program cards look good.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:08.430
Thanks.

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:11.140
Hurry up, you two!

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:12.020
Yes.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.730
What about the recording tape?

00:13:14.180 --> 00:13:15.440
Put it in that box on the left.

00:13:15.850 --> 00:13:18.110
Look at the scholars having a good time!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.570
The analysis is about to start.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.040
The Giant's parts have separated!

00:13:36.180 --> 00:13:37.740
We can't use the Geru like this!

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:41.170
If we can draw them near the Gerowa
 Zan, the Giant will be finished!

00:13:42.170 --> 00:13:43.710
There's that headache-causing machine!

00:13:48.630 --> 00:13:49.680
Damn it!

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:03.900
Not bad!

00:14:05.290 --> 00:14:08.120
Great! All three Giant parts are here!

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:09.410
Activate the Geru Field!

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.920
Damn you!

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:25.540
How did we fall for the same trick twice?

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.050
It's caught the Ideon units?

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.550
It's that light again!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.590
Starboard! Shoot down the Heavy Mobile Mecha!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.220
Is it giving us the headaches Cosmo spoke of?

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.150
That Heavy Mobile Mecha must
 be emitting those strange beams.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.020
Draw back!

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:45.690
Hatari...

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:47.590
Use the neutro beam scope!

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.070
So there are three generators?

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:54.700
Good!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.290
We're going to catch those three!

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.710
Bes! Move the Solo Ship!

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:01.330
Solo Ship! Full power!

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:19.480
The energy coefficient...

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:21.200
What's the result?

00:15:21.390 --> 00:15:24.650
Ide really does exist, as a form of energy.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:25.770
Really?

00:15:30.490 --> 00:15:32.880
The Ide is an infinite energy?

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:35.450
There's still no conclusion.

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:36.580
But...

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.790
If limitless energy really exists, the next task is...

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:43.020
This time, we need need to analyze the Ide system.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:44.920
Damn it!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.040
They've spotted us!

00:15:47.040 --> 00:15:47.880
You bastards!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:48.750
Who are you?!

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:52.680
I'm Kiranin Colbock of the Science Academy!

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:56.800
Outside of those from the Staff Officer
Headquarters, the use of Gloria is prohibited!

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:57.560
Get away from it!

00:15:57.560 --> 00:15:58.560
Wait!

00:15:58.560 --> 00:15:59.560
We...

00:15:59.560 --> 00:16:00.600
Don't waste your breath!

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:01.180
Wait!

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:07.520
Colbock!

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.490
Drop your weapons!

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.070
Sheryl!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.490
Grab the data and run!

00:16:15.490 --> 00:16:16.240
Joliver!

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.410
Sheryl, hurry up!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:22.000
I got it!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:43.320
I'll stop you!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.180
You're mine!

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:51.650
He's good!

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:57.200
Deck! Anything around us?

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.160
No enemies!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:58.740
Okay!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.750
It's over, we're done for!

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.070
Keep firing to the end! 
We'll have to hit it at least once!

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.590
You're tough!

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:16.010
Damn Giant!

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:26.660
Is that Giant truly invincible?

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.020
What the?

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.940
The escape capsule's controls aren't working!

00:17:38.860 --> 00:17:40.110
Come on, hurry!

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.870
The capsule!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:54.360
If the Galbo Jick has fallen, this mission has failed!

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:55.190
Pull back!

00:17:55.440 --> 00:17:57.090
There seems to be an escape capsule!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.090
I don't care, leave him there!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:02.970
Gije has failed my expectations,
I don't care even if he dies!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.100
What!?

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:11.400
It can't be!

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:12.980
They've left me behind!

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:14.780
Damn that Daram!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.570
Has he abandoned me!?

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:31.670
Colbock...

00:18:32.710 --> 00:18:33.630
Sheryl!

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:35.300
Did you manage to use Gloria?

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.180
Is something wrong?

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:57.230
The Earth has abandoned us.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:19:00.560
They can't defend their own people
 if they resign from fighting!

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:01.860
No.

00:19:01.860 --> 00:19:04.530
Sometimes the best defense is not to fight.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:05.530
What?

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:08.370
What do you mean, Sheryl?

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:12.830
We now know that the Solo Ship
 and Ideon possess infinite power.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:14.130
What'd you say?

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.530
What do you mean by infinite power?

00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:21.220
When the power of Ideon and
 the Solo Ship is released...

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:24.300
It could wipe out one Earth, two Earths...

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:28.020
No, that power could destroy even more than that!

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.430
Are you sure, Sheryl?

00:19:31.230 --> 00:19:33.100
Colbock investigated it.

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:34.440
I'm sure it's true!

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:38.150
The Ide is a system that contains the will of

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:40.260
hundreds of millions of people
of the Sixth Civilization.

00:19:40.450 --> 00:19:43.770
If we don't use it right, the Ide's power
could cause complete destruction.

00:19:43.810 --> 00:19:47.400
So, did you figure out the Ide's control system?

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:50.700
Control system?

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:53.170
Sheryl, get a hold of yourself!

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.670
If we don't know how to control it,
 then this is all for nothing!

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:58.130
Well...

00:19:58.550 --> 00:20:01.800
The soldiers on Moonland 
ended up killing Colbock...

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.010
There's nothing I can do.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.680
Even if we investigated...

00:20:04.970 --> 00:20:05.750
Sheryl.

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:07.330
I'll explain the rest.

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.470
Yes.

00:20:09.060 --> 00:20:09.970
Go ahead.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:16.170
I just feel a bit exhausted...

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:20.140
You'd better rest for a while.

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.320
I'm alright.

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:23.740
Bes...

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:29.030
I've got all the data here. 
I want to hear your opinions.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:30.240
I see...

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:34.990
So, the Ide contains the will of the Sixth Civilization?

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:38.800
Yes. The Ideonite barrier is sealing it in.

00:20:39.260 --> 00:20:43.080
Inside this space, the Ide manifests as energy.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:46.050
So, what caused it to awaken?

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:49.250
Probably the self-defense instinct of the sealed Ide.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:51.020
Self-defense instinct?

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:55.510
It means that the Ide began to operate in
 response to a genuinely pure act of self-defense.

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:57.860
A pure defensive instinct...

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:03.150
For instance, when an infant like Piper
Lou wanted to protect himself...

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.310
the Ide started to react.

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:11.370
Coincidentally, we brought babies like
Lou aboard the Solo Ship.

00:21:11.370 --> 00:21:15.290
Because of that, Ide's power protected us.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:17.280
That's what it means. If not...

00:21:17.500 --> 00:21:18.960
No. That's strange!

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:23.260
Why wouldn't an embodiment of self-
preservation instinct protect us?

00:21:23.260 --> 00:21:23.920
No.

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:28.370
If Ide itself would become an independent
 entity, there is a possibility.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:30.850
When the Solo Ship and the
Ideon were completed,

00:21:31.140 --> 00:21:34.390
and the power of numerous 
consciousnesses become one power...

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:40.080
The Ide will destroy others to prevent them
from harming its own existence.

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:42.540
That even may have been...

00:21:42.690 --> 00:21:45.680
the fate of the people of the Sixth
Civilization that gave birth to the Ide.

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:47.720
It's the Ide's ego.

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:50.100
A selfish power.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:52.990
It's nothing like love...

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.570
That's right.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.750
We're being taken in by the Ide.

00:22:00.170 --> 00:22:01.250
Taken in?

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:04.800
To the infinite power, Ide?

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.300
But Karala!

00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:09.430
What about the legend of the Buff Clan?

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:12.250
Wasn't the Ide supposed to
 be awakened by a righteous power?

00:22:13.260 --> 00:22:13.930
But...

00:22:14.770 --> 00:22:20.620
Why did the Sixth Civilization which
created the system go extinct?

00:22:21.560 --> 00:22:24.440
It's because they, like us,
couldn't control it, isn't it?

00:22:24.440 --> 00:22:25.530
Well...

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:29.450
That's possible, but...

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:32.160
Pretty!

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:54.970
<i>The Earth Union Military Warship Musashi
demands the Solo Ship be handed over.</i>

00:22:56.020 --> 00:23:01.420
<i>When Sheryl goes to negotiate, she learns that the
Earth Union Military intends to acquire the Ide.</i>

00:23:01.770 --> 00:23:05.540
<i>However, the Buff Clan takes advantage
 of the situation and sinks the Musashi.</i>

00:23:05.820 --> 00:23:08.280
<i>Sheryl is caught up in the flames.</i>

00:23:09.450 --> 00:23:14.370
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant Ideon:
"Wrath of the Wave Leader Gun."</i>

